Title: Presentation of the 139th to 146th Reports of the Standing Committee on Science and Technology, Environment and Forests on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) in respect of various Departments./Ministries 

12.03 hrs.

STANDING COMMITTEE ON SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY, ENVIRONMENT AND FORESTS

One Hundred Thirty Ninth to One Hundred Forty Sixth Reports

DR. SUJAN CHAKRABORTY (JADAVPUR): I beg to lay on the Table the following Reports (Hindi and English versions) of the Standing Committee on Science & Technology, Environment & Forests:- 

(1) 139th report on Action Taken by the Ministry of Environment & Forests on the recommendations contained in the 131st report of the Committee on the Demands for Grants (2004-2005) of the Ministry of Environment & Forests; 

(2) 140th report on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) pertaining to the Department of Science & Technology; 

(3) 141st report on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) pertaining to the Department of Biotechnology; 

(4) 142nd report on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) pertaining to the Department of Scientific and Industrial Research; 

(5) 143rd report on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) pertaining to the Department of Ocean Development; 

(6) 144th report on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) pertaining to the Department of Space; 

(7) 145th report on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) pertaining to the Department of Atomic Energy; and 

(8) 146th report on Demands for Grants (2005-2006) pertaining to the Ministry of Environment & Forests.
